WEBVTT

1
00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:19,700
It's okay. Captain Qi Xuan is supporting him.

2
00:00:20,180 --> 00:00:26,740
You take him away and I will divorce him.

3
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:34,570
Can you kill anyone if they don't even think about leaving?

4
00:00:35,210 --> 00:00:38,450
The top brass will keep one alive and kill the rest.
